          "id": "341bb9b9270700f2eddf0f46c883b516b35d30c2",
          "message": "Implement OTLP Profiles development-version metadata (#16009)\n\n#### Description\n\nImplement the [OTLP Profiles development-version\nmetadata](https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-proto/blob/1b0835ea26b8499510eae45a1ffa13a2b51d30c6/docs/specification.md#profiles-development-version).\n\n#### Link to tracking issue\n\nCloses\nhttps://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/issues/16147.\n\nRelated to\nhttps://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-proto/pull/857.\n\n#### Testing\n\nAdded unit tests for each updated component. \n\n#### Documentation\n\nUpdated receiver and exporter documentation as needed.\n\n#### Authorship\n\n- [X] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Pablo Baeyens <pablo.baeyens@datadoghq.com>",
