          "id": "932ee30af2c0621e45134dc41d261b1a34b94b95",
          "message": "[chore][cmd/mdatagen] Avoid duplicate custom validator calls for nested object properties (#16189)\n\n<!--Ex. Fixing a bug - Describe the bug and how this fixes the issue.\nEx. Adding a feature - Explain what this achieves.-->\n#### Description\n\nSkip emitting a `CustomValidator` entry for a property when it's a\n\"promoted\" nested object (not itself a referenced type, but an inline\nobject with its own properties) — since that custom validator is already\nemitted separately when the type itself is processed), this prevents it\nfrom being generated/called twice.\n\n<!--Authorship attestation. See AGENTS.md for details. AI agents must\nnot check this box on behalf\nof the user; the human author must check it themselves before the PR is\nready for review.-->\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\n<!--Please delete paragraphs that you did not use before submitting.-->",
