          "message": "[receiver/otlp] Migrate receiver config to metadata.yaml (#16212)\n\n<!--Ex. Fixing a bug - Describe the bug and how this fixes the issue.\nEx. Adding a feature - Explain what this achieves.-->\n#### Description\n\nMigrate the OTLP receiver configuration to the metadata schema. Generate\nthe config structs, defaults, schema, and associated tests from\nmetadata.yaml, while preserving the receiver’s existing defaults and\nprotocol validation.\n\n<!--Authorship attestation. See AGENTS.md for details. AI agents must\nnot check this box on behalf\nof the user; the human author must check it themselves before the PR is\nready for review.-->\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\n<!--Please delete paragraphs that you did not use before submitting.-->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Pablo Baeyens <pablo.baeyens@datadoghq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Pablo Baeyens <pbaeyens31+github@gmail.com>",
